---
title: "generation_role_management (stem-system: Clubhouse Manager)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_session: server action invoked
    q_check_session --> q_error_unauth: no authenticated session
    q_check_session --> q_check_admin: session valid
    q_error_unauth --> [*]: return error
    q_check_admin --> q_error_forbidden: checkAdmin() returns false
    q_check_admin --> q_determine_op: user is admin
    q_error_forbidden --> [*]: return 403 forbidden
    q_determine_op --> q_list_roles: operation = list generation roles
    q_determine_op --> q_create_role: operation = create mapping
    q_determine_op --> q_update_role: operation = update mapping
    q_determine_op --> q_delete_role: operation = delete mapping
    q_list_roles --> [*]: return all generation-to-discord_role_id mappings
    q_create_role --> q_validate_gen: validate generation number and discord_role_id
    q_validate_gen --> q_insert_role: insert into generation_roles(generation, discord_role_id)
    q_insert_role --> [*]: return success
    q_update_role --> q_validate_update: validate update fields
    q_validate_update --> q_apply_role_update: update generation_roles record
    q_apply_role_update --> [*]: return success
    q_delete_role --> q_remove_role: delete from generation_roles
    q_remove_role --> [*]: return success

    note right of q_check_admin
        INV-001: generation role management is admin-only
    end note

    note right of q_create_role
        INV-002: generation number must be unique in generation_roles table
        INV-003: discord_role_id must be a valid Discord snowflake ID
    end note
